  "title": "Command injection in the uploads:gather rake task",
  "summary": "### Impact\r\nUpload records restored from a crafted backup can run shell commands when a sysadmin runs the `uploads:gather` rake task.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\nDo not run `uploads:gather` on a database restored from an untrusted backup.",
